These 340 .npz files are a packed derivative of the ARC-AGI-3 human replay release published by ARC Prize
(https://arcprize.org/blog/arc-agi-3-human-dataset, 14 Apr 2026; the public mirror holds 340 sessions, the post
counts 342). Each file holds the frames, actions, levels and states of one released session, renamed by the
session's own file name. The source names no licence for the replays, so these files are not covered by this
repository's MIT-0 licence; they keep the terms of the original release. Re-pack them from the mirror with
pack() in src/arc_prize_2026/arc3/level_transfer.py if you prefer to start from the source.
